          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "The dataset has been updated (22 October 2021) to extend towards vaccination data on regional (GGD regio) and municipal level. Furthermore, the data now also includes the year 2019. The command documentation now also incorporates graphical analyses.\nUpdatet files: \n*Dofile.do\nNew command documentation for the statistical analysis. Replaces old Dofile.do.\n*Merged3.dta\nNew Dataset, now with municipal and regional data, and with data from 2019. Replaces Merged.dta.\n*Dunntest3.dta\nDataset for the Dunntest. New file.\n*Attachment5_LIWC.dta\nUpdated LIWC output based on new data. Replaces Attachment5_LIWC output.ods"
